      "representative_excerpt": "While this rule is based on current data, there is still uncertainty about how contaminants may behave over time, particularly in landfills where they could impact groundwater and the nearby communities. Public health matters because it focuses on preventing harm before it occurs. Decisions like this do not just affect industry; they also impact real...",
