      "representative_length": 1534,
      "representative_excerpt": "If this refinery sludge is to be delisted and allowed to be put into a Subtitle D landfill, that is exposing anybody who uses that landfill to these harmful VOCs. Instead of delisting this sludge, I suggest using a process to detoxify and eliminate this hazardous material. Simply leaving it in a landfill will only cause more problems for the future....",
